        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Lwm rapna laa nuhmei chamv he adih kamv gay cho!",
            "“Doulaneic, aseic, tingsaengzaeng Jisu nchamc e!”",
            "Paapc phunghmei ta kuaklou bam e, naumei tiigay e;",
            "Zaengsiimei ta tiineihlaa e, pwanzingh khaam ngam e.",
            "",
            "“Doulaneic, aseic, tingsaeng- zaeng Jisu nchamc e!”",
            "Ramh guayna kalaic e Jisu thu kalaih mak ge,",
            "Kazanc hym daic diu!",
            "Kazanc hym daic diu!",
            "Ramh guay kumc Jisu kalaih mak,",
            "Kazanc hym daic diu!",
            "",
            "2 Jisu paapc phunghmei nunc Pam e, paapc mei ta phu e;",
            "Paapc mei lunghlaicna kalum o, ney o, khuksunna;",
            "Jisu saa e: “Tii ’khuai lak e, paapc taanc dat ri tho!”",
            "Kuakloupui lat ’taw nic saa e, reynungc saa kan kumc.",
            "",
            "3 Dui kamuatcmei duipui chung khou tatmei pu hei #^7,",
            "Galili khou kumc ’niu khou nic pwanzingh khaam ngam e;",
            "Gethsamani khou kapna huayney kanmei pu #^7,",
            "Aniu ryanra akhaengv ’khavna phungc ’duanghlou bam e.",
            "",
            "4 Emma-u thangc tatmei nunc lev Kamei tat ’chamc kumc,",
            "Panty chaenglwan khou hei ’niu lev tat ’chamcna bam e;",
            "Muangh khou ku kanmei Jisu 7}$ ’niu how nuangc ni the;",
            "Pou Jisu key katumclou tho, aniw huay bam e!"
          ]
        }
      },
